{#
  Editor's note. A cream box with a 3px gold left rule, used for the top and
  bottom webmaster notes. Renders nothing when the text is empty.

  The handle differs by entry type, so the caller passes the value rather than
  this partial guessing: webmasterNoteTop / webmasterNoteBottom on most types,
  personWebmasterNote* on People, obitWebmasterNote* on Obituaries and
  mpWebmasterNote* on Military Profiles.

  Params:
    text   the note, plain text or simple HTML
#}
{% if text is defined and text is not empty and text|trim %}
  {% css %}
  .rec-note{background:#FDF7EA;border-left:3px solid #C4A031;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 28px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#2C2C2C}
  .rec-note:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
  .rec-note a{color:#A9842B}
  .rec-note--bottom{margin:32px 0 0}
  {% endcss %}
  <div class="rec-note{{ bottom is defined and bottom ? ' rec-note--bottom' : '' }}">{{ text|trim|raw }}</div>
{% endif %}
